      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo></math> constant",
