  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>PdV</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>nC</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></msub><mi>dT</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mi>nRT</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mfrac><mi>dV</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>nC</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></msub><mi>dT</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mi>dV</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mi>dT</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>CT</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>,&nbsp;Where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is a constant.</p>"
